			"Message": "feat(Mountain): Add comprehensive IPC handlers and Effect creators\n\nAdd WindServiceHandlers for IPC bridge between Wind frontend services and Mountain backend:\n- Commands, Configuration, Extensions, FileSystem (legacy + native), Model, NativeHost\n- Navigation history, Output channels, Search, Storage, Terminal/PTY, UI features\n- Including Utilities for path resolution, percent-decoding, metadata conversion\n\nAdd CreateEffectForRequest effect creators for the Effect-TS system:\n- Domain modules: Authentication, Clipboard, Commands, Configuration, Debug\n- Diagnostics, Documents, FileSystem, FileWatcher, Git, Keybinding, Languages\n- NativeHost, SCM, Search, Secrets, StatusBar, Storage, Task, Terminal\n- TreeView, UserInterface, Webview, WindowUI, Workspace\n\nThese handlers expose VS Code-compatible IPC surface to the Wind frontend and enable the Effect-TS service layer to dispatch typed effects through Mountain's backend.",
			"SHA": "94e759aa4c612ec4829f8de6108cff4451338db7"
